                "text": "Today Republicans blocked a bill that would stop states from banning IVF treatment. That\u2019s outrageous. \n\nThis is pretty simple - Republicans want to put government in charge of women\u2019s bodies. \n\nAnd we need to stop them. https://t.co/7mAMLI9xIk",
