                "text": "Let's be clear what these \"Medicaid concerns\" are. \n\nIt's $880 BILLION of Medicaid cuts. That's a meat cleaver to the insurance program that covers millions of kids and seniors. \n\nIt means nursing homes and rural hospitals close. Addiction treatment vanishes. Very sick kids die.",
